      ("0.4", "Subscription to changes where needed", "N", "not supported yet; planned for the next version", "—"),
      ("7.2", "Open geo formats", "E", "delivers GeoPackage, an open OGC standard, instead of GeoJSON; equivalence explained in the tender, p. 15", "✓"),
    ),
